WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:07.440
&gt;&gt;&gt; A LANDMARK MOMENT.
A BLACK SUPREME COURT JUSTICE

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:12.378
HAS BEEN SWORN IN TO THE HIGHEST
COURT FOR THE FIRST TIME IN ITS

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:14.614
185-YEAR HISTORY.
&gt;&gt; I WILL FAITHFULLY DISCHARGE

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:17.317
THE DUTIES OF THE OFFICE OF
SUPREME COURT JUSTICE.

00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:19.152
&gt;&gt; OF THE OFFICE OF SUPREME
COURT JUSTICE.

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:22.122
&gt;&gt; ACCORDING TO THE BEST OF MY
ABILITY.

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:24.524
&gt;&gt; ACCORDING TO THE BEST OF MY
ABILITY.

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:28.094
&gt;&gt; THAT IS JUSTICE KIRA HARRIS
BOLDEN.

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:30.864
HER APPOINTMENT COMES AT A
SIGNIFICANT TIME FOR MICHIGAN'S

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:32.732
SUPREME COURT.
LAST YEAR THE COURT HAD A NUMBER

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:36.202
OF KEY DECISIONS.
THEY ORDERED AN ABORTION RIGHTS

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:40.039
INITIATIVE TO APPEAR ON THE
NOVEMBER BALLOT, BANNED

00:00:40.039 --> 00:00:42.976
DISCRIMINATION AGAINST LGBTQ
PEOPLE AND RULED THAT ONE-PERSON

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:46.379
GRAND JURIES CAN'T ISSUE
INDICTMENTS AGAINST STATE

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:48.047
OFFICIALS.
IT LED TO CHARGES BEING

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:52.051
DISMISSED AGAINST A FORMER
GOVERNOR IN CONNECTION WITH THE

00:00:52.051 --> 00:00:54.954
FLINT WATER CRISIS.
THIS TERM THE COURT ALSO HAS A

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:58.891
LOT ON ITS PLATE.
JUSTICE BOLDEN'S APPOINTMENT IS

00:00:58.891 --> 00:01:02.228
NOT ONLY HISTORIC, WAIT UNTIL
YOU HEAR HER FAMILY'S LEGACY OF

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:05.832
INJUSTICE IN THE HANDS OF THE
LEGAL SYSTEM.

00:01:05.832 --> 00:01:10.803
&gt;&gt; ONE DAY THIS LITTLE GIRL CAME
TO ME AND SAID MS. KYRA, CAN

00:01:10.803 --> 00:01:13.806
GIRLS GO TO COLLEGE?
I LOOKED AT HER AND SAID, YES,

00:01:13.806 --> 00:01:15.642
I'M A GIRL.
I'M IN COLLEGE.

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:20.146
SHE TURNS TO THE LITTLE GIRL
NEXT TO HER AND SAYS, SEE, I

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:22.615
TOLD YOU.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: LITTLE GIRLS SAW

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:24.951
THEMSELVES IN KYRA HARRIS
BOLDEN.

00:01:24.951 --> 00:01:29.355
&gt;&gt; THIS HAS BEEN A LONG JOURNEY
FOR ALL OF US.

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:31.991
&gt;&gt; Reporter: TODAY FOR THE FIRST
TIME THEY CAN LOOK UP AND SEE

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:37.096
WHAT ELSE THEY CAN BE.
&gt;&gt; KYRA WILL BE THE FIRST BLACK

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:40.567
WOMAN EVER TO SERVE ON THE
MICHIGAN SUPREME COURT.

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:44.337
&gt;&gt; Reporter: WITH THAT, HISTORY
WAS MADE AS MICHIGAN GOVERNOR

00:01:44.337 --> 00:01:48.274
GRETCHEN WHITMER APPOINTED
BOLDEN TO THE STATE'S HIGHEST

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:50.176
COURT.
&gt;&gt; 185 YEARS WE'VE NEVER HAD AN

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:53.012
AFRICAN AMERICAN WOMAN ON THE
STATE'S HIGHEST COURT.

00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:57.483
IT'S ABOUT DAMN TIME.
&gt;&gt; IT'S JUST BEEN AN HONOR, AND

00:01:57.483 --> 00:02:02.222
JUST BEEN SO SURREAL TO BE
APPOINTED TO THE HIGHEST COURT

00:02:02.222 --> 00:02:06.659
IN THE STATE OF MICHIGAN AND BE
RESPONSIBLE FOR SOME REALLY

00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:09.095
IMPORTANT DECISIONS.
&gt;&gt; WHAT DO YOU THINK MAKES YOU

00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:11.831
TEAR UP?
&gt;&gt; BECAUSE THIS MEANS SO MUCH TO

00:02:11.831 --> 00:02:16.903
SO MANY PEOPLE.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: JUSTICE BOLDEN'S

00:02:16.903 --> 00:02:20.306
JOURNEY TO THIS COURT, THOUGH,
BEGAN NEARLY A CENTURY AGO WITH

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:28.181
A TRAGEDY.
&gt;&gt; JESSE LEE BONDS, MY GREAT

00:02:28.181 --> 00:02:31.618
GRANDFATHER WAS LYNCHED IN
TENNESSEE IN 1939 AFTER ASKING A

00:02:31.618 --> 00:02:34.821
STORE OWNER FOR A RECEIPT.
HE WAS BEATEN AND CASTRATED AND

00:02:34.821 --> 00:02:39.592
THROWN INTO THE LOCAL RIVER, AND
THE CORONER DEEMED IT AN

00:02:39.592 --> 00:02:43.396
ACCIDENTAL DROWNING.
AS A RESULT HIS MURDERERS WALKED

00:02:43.396 --> 00:02:44.797
FREE.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THAT INJUSTICE

00:02:44.797 --> 00:02:48.501
DROVE BOLDEN TO LAW SCHOOL.
&gt;&gt; ONCE I REALIZE THAD THAT WAS

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:50.970
SOMETHING THAT HAPPENED IN MY
OWN FAMILY.

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:53.773
&gt;&gt; LESS THAN 100 YEARS AGO.
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:02:53.773 --> 00:02:56.876
I JUST FEET THE NEED TO BE A
PART OF THE JUSTICE SYSTEM AND

00:02:56.876 --> 00:03:01.748
TO GO TO LAW SCHOOL AND FIND MY
WAY IN THAT.

00:03:01.748 --> 00:03:05.084
&gt;&gt; IS YOUR GREAT GRANDFATHER'S
LYNCHING THE REASON YOU BELIEVE

00:03:05.084 --> 00:03:08.388
YOU BECAME A LAWYER?
&gt;&gt; IT WAS DEFINITELY A LARGE

00:03:08.388 --> 00:03:13.026
PART OF IT.
&gt;&gt; SHOW XI WOULD GO ON TO SERVE

00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:15.328
TWO TERMS IN THE STATE
LEGISLATURE AND THEN TAKE A

00:03:15.328 --> 00:03:17.263
LEAP, A CHANCE AT MAKING
HISTORY.

00:03:17.263 --> 00:03:22.368
&gt;&gt; WE NEED TO MAKE SURE THAT WE
HAVE JUSTICES ON OUR MICHIGAN

00:03:22.368 --> 00:03:27.373
SUPREME COURT THAT BELIEVE IN
EQUAL JUSTICE UNDER THE LAW.

00:03:27.373 --> 00:03:30.109
&gt;&gt; SHE DIDN'T WIN THAT RACE, BUT
WHEN A SEAT ON THE COURT OPENED

00:03:30.109 --> 00:03:34.080
UP THIS SUMMER, SHE WAS THE
GOVERNOR'S FIRST CHOICE.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:38.017
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU.
THANK YOU.

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:42.121
THANK YOU VERY MUCH.
&gt;&gt; HER DAUGHTER EMERSON NOT YET

00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:45.825
FIVE MONTHS OLD TOO YOUNG TO
KNOW THE HISTORY HER MOTHER HAS

00:03:45.825 --> 00:03:48.294
MADE.
&gt;&gt; EMERSON IN JUST A FEW

00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:51.964
GENERATIONS OUR FAMILY HAS GONE
FROM LYNCHING TO LAW SCHOOL,

00:03:51.964 --> 00:03:56.903
FROM INJUSTICE TO A CAPITAL J
JUSTICE.

00:03:56.903 --> 00:04:03.476
&gt;&gt; FROM INJUSTICE TO CAPITAL J
JUSTICE IS REALLY -- IT'S

00:04:03.476 --> 00:04:04.944
AMAZING.
IT'S AMAZING THAT WE CAN MAKE

00:04:04.944 --> 00:04:07.580
THIS TYPE OF PROGRESS FOR OUR
FAMILY.

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:11.050
&gt;&gt; WHAT DO YOU SAY TO PEOPLE WHO
LOOK AT THE STATE OF RACISM IN

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:17.090
AMERICA TODAY AND DON'T SEE IT
AS ENOUGH PROGRESS?

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:20.727
&gt;&gt; IT'S NOT.
IT'S NOT ENOUGH.

00:04:20.727 --> 00:04:25.231
IT'S ABSOLUTELY UNACCEPTABLE
THAT IN 2022 WE ARE JUST NOW

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:28.401
HAVING THE FIRST BLACK WOMAN ON
THE MICHIGAN SUPREME COURT.

00:04:28.401 --> 00:04:31.871
THERE HAS NEVER BEEN A BLACK
WOMAN THAT'S BEEN A GOVERNOR IN

00:04:31.871 --> 00:04:33.773
THE UNITED STATES HISTORY,
RIGHT?

00:04:33.773 --> 00:04:37.610
IT'S NOT ACCEPTABLE, BUT WE
STILL HAVE TO WORK HARD AND WE

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:40.012
STILL HAVE TO TRY TO BREAK DOWN
THESE BARRIERS.

00:04:40.012 --> 00:04:45.318
&gt;&gt; AND 2022, IT TOOK TILL NOW TO
GET THE FIRST BLACK WOMAN ON THE

00:04:45.318 --> 00:04:46.753
U.S. SUPREME COURT.
&gt;&gt; YES, YES.

00:04:46.753 --> 00:04:53.326
&gt;&gt; WHEN YOU THINK ABOUT JUSTICE
KETANJI BROWN JACKSON JUST A FEW

00:04:53.326 --> 00:04:55.695
MONTHS BEFORE YOU, WHAT DO YOU
THINK?

00:04:55.695 --> 00:05:01.067
&gt;&gt; I THINK IT'S ONE OF THOSE
MOMENTS WHERE YOU KNOW IT'S

00:05:01.067 --> 00:05:03.236
POSSIBLE, RIGHT?
THE SAME WAY THAT PEOPLE HAVE

00:05:03.236 --> 00:05:07.640
SAID THAT THEY LOOK AT ME, THE
SAME WAY I LOOK AT HER.

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:11.611
&gt;&gt; REALLY?
&gt;&gt; SHE'S AMAZING, BUT SHE IS A

00:05:11.611 --> 00:05:14.113
REPRESENTATION OF WHAT IS
POSSIBLE.

00:05:14.113 --> 00:05:20.353
&gt;&gt; ARE WE FIRED UP?
ARE WE READY TO GO?

00:05:20.353 --> 00:05:23.556
&gt;&gt; JUSTICE BOLDEN WILL BE UNIQUE
ON THIS COURT, AS THE ONLY

00:05:23.556 --> 00:05:26.659
JUSTICE WHO WAS PREVIOUSLY A
STATE LAWMAKER.

00:05:26.659 --> 00:05:30.263
&gt;&gt; SO THAT ALSO OPENS THE DOOR
TO OTHER CRITICS WHO SAY, WELL,

00:05:30.263 --> 00:05:34.133
YOU'RE A DEMOCRAT, YOU'RE
PARTISAN, YOU SERVED IN THE

00:05:34.133 --> 00:05:36.068
LEGISLATURE, YOU RAN AS A
DEMOCRAT.

00:05:36.068 --> 00:05:40.106
HOW DO YOU SHED THAT?
&gt;&gt; ALL JUDGES AND JUSTICES HAVE

00:05:40.106 --> 00:05:44.944
PERSONAL POINTS OF VIEW.
SO I DON'T THINK I'M DIFFERENT

00:05:44.944 --> 00:05:47.246
IN THAT.
MY JOB AS A JUSTICE IS TO

00:05:47.246 --> 00:05:53.986
INTERPRET THE LAWS.
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE THE OPPORTUNITY TO

00:05:53.986 --> 00:05:56.122
PROTECT JUSTICE FOR GENERATIONS
TO COME.

00:05:56.122 --> 00:06:00.726
DID YOU KNOW THAT?
&gt;&gt; IN A FITTING FULL CIRCLE,

00:06:00.726 --> 00:06:05.832
SHE'LL FILL THE SEAT OF CHIEF
JUSTICE BRIDGET McCORMACK WAS

00:06:05.832 --> 00:06:08.301
THE FIRST SHE WORKED ON A DECADE
AGO.

00:06:08.301 --> 00:06:14.106
&gt;&gt; THE STATE IS GETTING A SMART,
SAVVY, AND HARD WORKING PUBLIC

00:06:14.106 --> 00:06:17.210
SERVANT AS ITS NEWEST JUSTICE.
&gt;&gt; I KNOW THE WEIGHT OF THIS

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:18.511
JOB.
I KNOW WHAT IT MEANS.

00:06:18.511 --> 00:06:24.851
IT'S ALWAYS BEEN MY GOAL TO PULL
PEOPLE WITH ME -- VICE PRESIDENT

00:06:24.851 --> 00:06:27.186
KAMALA SAID MAYBE THE FIRST, BUT
NOT THE LAST.

00:06:27.186 --> 00:06:30.723
THAT'S JUST KIND OF THE MANTRA
THAT I LIVE BY.

00:06:30.723 --> 00:06:33.559
&gt;&gt; WHAT AN HONOR TO SIT WITH
HER.

00:06:33.559 --> 00:06:37.430
I HAVE TO MENTION ALPHA KAPPA
ALPHA.

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:42.034
WE TALKED SO MUCH ABOUT THE
BARRIERS THAT SHE'S BREAKING

00:06:42.034 --> 00:06:45.071
ALONG WITH FOLLOWING THE LIKES
OF VICE PRESIDENT KAMALA HARRIS,

00:06:45.071 --> 00:06:48.407
TONI MORRISON AND SO MANY MORE.
&gt;&gt; THAT PART IS IMPORTANT

00:06:48.407 --> 00:06:53.012
BECAUSE WHEN YOU THINK ABOUT THE
BLACK SORORITIES, THE IMPACT

00:06:53.012 --> 00:06:56.682
THEY HAVE ON ELECTIONS AROUND
THE COUNTRY, NOT ONLY JUST FOR

00:06:56.682 --> 00:07:00.419
WOMEN.
THEY GET PEOPLE -- THEY GET OUT

00:07:00.419 --> 00:07:03.623
THE VOTE.
IN LOUISIANA THE LAST

00:07:03.623 --> 00:07:07.093
GUBERNATORIAL ELECTION, THE
BLACK SORORITIES REALLY HELPED

00:07:07.093 --> 00:07:11.831
IN A RED STATE, PUSHED AND
HELPED TO ELECT A DEMOCRATIC

00:07:11.831 --> 00:07:13.466
GOVERNOR THERE.
BUT SHE IS --

00:07:13.466 --> 00:07:16.235
&gt;&gt; A FORCE.
34 ONLY.

00:07:16.235 --> 00:07:18.471
&gt;&gt; AMAZING.
&gt;&gt; I WANT TO SAY ONE THING.

00:07:18.471 --> 00:07:25.311
SHE HAS A 5-MONTH-OLD BABY, SO
SHE RAN THIS CAMPAIGN PREGNANT,

00:07:25.311 --> 00:07:28.380
CRISSCROSSING THE STATE.
AS SOMEONE WHO HAS HAD BABIES,

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:30.783
DOING ANY JOB, LET ALONE THAT
JOB IS DIFFICULT.

00:07:30.783 --> 00:07:35.154
HER HUSBAND TOOK TWO MONTHS
PATERNITY LEAVE AND WAS AN EQUAL

00:07:35.154 --> 00:07:36.656
CAREGIVER AT HOME SO SHE COULD
DO THAT.

00:07:36.656 --> 00:07:39.091
WE TALK A LOT ABOUT WHAT IT
TAKES TO LIFT PEOPLE UP.

00:07:39.091 --> 00:07:42.295
BIG PART OF THIS FOR HER SHE
SAID AS WELL HAVING THAT EQUAL

00:07:42.295 --> 00:07:44.964
PARTNER.
&gt;&gt; I'M NOT SO SURPRISED SHE DID

00:07:44.964 --> 00:07:47.967
THIS PREGNANT.
WHAT DID THEY SAY ABOUT GINGER

00:07:47.967 --> 00:07:54.173
ROGERS, SHE HAD TO DO EVERYTHING
FRED ASTAIRE DID, BUT BACKWARDS

00:07:54.173 --> 00:07:58.711
AND IN HEELS.
WOMEN AMAZINGLY CAN DO THOSE

00:07:58.711 --> 00:08:00.279
THINGS.
GUYS, WE'RE NOT THERE YET.

00:08:00.279 --> 00:08:01.948
&gt;&gt; A DELIGHT TO SPENT TIME WITH
HER.

